                  <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-sky-300 bg-slate-900 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-700/60 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                    <span class="truncate">ABSTRACT – CPG 2026 – [Nama Penulis]</span>
                    <button 
                      type="button" 
                      id="btn-copy-subject" 
