                </div>

                <a 
                  href={mailtoLink}
                  class="w-full text-center py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-sky-600 hover:from-sky-400 hover:to-sky-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition block"
                >
                  Buka Aplikasi Email & Kirim Sekarang &rarr;
